{"id":"248337","name":"黄瓜干咸菜","author":"小草根家庭美食","authorId":"8611332","desc":"","cover":"images/248337/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜干","amount":"120克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1小勺"},{"name":"鱼香酱","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"芝麻","amount":"10克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"10克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"1克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜干提前泡上","img":"images/248337/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡软后，反复清洗，然后挤干","img":"images/248337/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备鱼香酱，没有就用老干妈辣酱或者辣椒油","img":"images/248337/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄瓜里面加适量的盐，鸡精，生抽，然后加一勺鱼香酱","img":"images/248337/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加熟芝麻","img":"images/248337/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，腌制10分钟，入味就可以了。","img":"images/248337/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品","img":"images/248337/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"还可以加熟花生碎，加胡萝卜丝等。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}